# <type>: <summary in imperative mood, lowercase, no period, <=72 chars>
#
# Body (optional, wrap ~72 cols). Explain what changed and why, as "- " bullets.
#
# --- convention ------------------------------------------------------------
# type    feat | fix | perf | docs | refactor | test | ci | chore | content
# summary imperative ("add", not "added"/"adds"), lowercase, no trailing period.
#
# "content" is for projects.json / image edits - the site's data rather
# than its code.
#
# examples
#   feat: group original work above coursework on the projects page
#   content: add the P01 case study and screenshots
#   ci: pin pyright and add the gunicorn boot check
#   perf: self-host the webfonts and minify the stylesheet
